ain with tip #6! \ud83c\udf0d\u2708\ufe0f Save this before your next trip! I\u2019ve used Samsonite suitcases for the last 10 years as I find they\u2019re the best quality and durability. Their new Paralux range is amazing as it comes with packing cubes that fit the suitcase perfectly, dual access opening (so you can access your stuff quickly without fully unpacking!) and even a built-in AirTag holder! Such a clever and practical design! Which tip did you not know? @samsonite_au @luxury.escapes \n\n#packinghacks #packwithme #traveltips #travelhacks", "timestamp": "2026-07-17T06:02:39.000Z", "videoDuration": 35.177, "videoPlayCount": 277334, "videoViewCount": 6299, "likesCount": 2384, "commentsCount": 58, "displayUrl": "https://scontent-phx1-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/754068839_18101650646190993_3731975340479742152_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p1080x1080_sh2.08_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-phx1-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=109&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gEyO-VykEPPTxEKJ_PhTGi3_RIc_mKhPhSrXYVyJ-HhUz2l65CTBO2cV_qHTyTCU1Vszp8n1hl81Vgd_SHG-PY1&_nc_ohc=lnSlAIjf7VQQ7kNvwH75WWr&_nc_gid=wuE7r31EZ6AgXY8g-nyj-A&edm=ADp7STQBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AQGrAuvzIBgyuCp-wvC5yPKtCZxY-6VgvExjkDz7noO3Xg&oe=6A74FF67&_nc_sid=c6f216", "videoUrl": "https://scontent-phx1-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQP1kQ2i54tIqsr8HCUI8SJmzAbKQ9ZJRD927pxVrEAbNLLE6QsTKNSTcgGedp50w_QW-fXjhQOpFrIWgNmlE-4KxarmQWFKND3LxcU.mp4?_nc_cat=105&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent-phx1-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=90xvwpJGSZkQ7kNvwF1fB3_&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJUFMuQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MSIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6MTA4NDQ0OTI1NDI2MjkwNSwiYXNzZXRfYWdlX2RheXMiOjE2LCJ2aV91c2VjYXNlX2lkIjoxMjM3NCwiZHVyYXRpb25fcyI6MzUsInVybGdlbl9zb3VyY2UiOiJ3d3cifQ%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&vs=8e2130426bc0ba89&_nc_&_nc_gid=wuE7r31EZ6AgXY8g-nyj-A&_nc_zt=28&_nc_ss=7a22e&oh=00_AQFbrXZwHBf3rDgf5R36lrUOk5Vn3aCSzd0c_OwCQfhGcw&oe=6A712896", "musicInfo": {"artist_name": "Alex Blue", "song_name": "Bet You Regret It", "uses_original_audio": false, "should_mute_audio": false, "should_mute_audio_reason": "", "audio_id": "375546982121484"}, "ownerUsername": "mama_mila_au", "ownerFullName": "Chantel Mila", "transcript": "Seven hacks that will change the way you pack forever. Pack your suitcase vertically to fit in more clothes and packing cubes are also a game changer to keep everything organized. Our Samsonite Parallax suitcase actually came with these packing cubes so they're a perfect fit. Stop toiletries leaking by placing cling wrap under the lid and place necklaces through a straw to prevent them tangling. Samsonite's Parallax range has dual access which means that you can access things right from the front of the case. Hide an air tag in your luggage so you always know where your bag is even if the airline doesn't. And stuff your shoes with socks or chargers to save space then store them in a separate compartment so nothing touches your clothes.", "history": [{"date": "2026-07-18", "plays": 187896, "likes": 1528, "comments": 52}, {"date": "2026-07-19", "plays": 191669, "likes": 1575, "comments": 53}, {"date": "2026-07-26", "plays": 254909, "likes": 2142, "comments": 56}, {"date": "2026-08-02", "plays": 277334, "likes": 2384, "comments": 58}], "still_climbing": false, "hook_type": "List", "is_relevant": false}, {"shortCode": "DaxD8v2yZNa", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DaxD8v2yZNa/", "caption": "You\u2019ll never lose a random pillowcase again with tip #2 \ud83d\ude4c which one will you try first? Hope these quick tricks were helpful lovelies xx \n\n#linencloset #linencupboard #tipsandtricks #hometips", "timestamp": "2026-07-14T08:29:30.000Z", "videoDuration": 18.668, "videoPlayCount": 282341, "videoViewCount": 2673, "likesCount": 2734, "commentsCount": 28, "displayUrl": "https://scontent-yyz1-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/748175730_18100711004190993_6821470446071013372_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p1080x1080_sh2.08_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-yyz1-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=109&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gHE5HNguS2HTiv8dvQRXpp91