 "is_relevant": true}, {"shortCode": "Dae8AUdyyJm", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/Dae8AUdyyJm/", "caption": "#3 makes the biggest difference to your hair \ud83d\ude4c Fun fact, back when I was a teenager, I worked for 4 years at hairdressing salons and these are some of the tips I picked up along the way! I still use them to this day and they work so well \ud83d\ude4c save this for your next salon appointment. Hope this was helpful lovelies xx hair by the lovely team at @uvasalon \u2665\ufe0f \n\n#tipsandtricks #lifehacks #hairhack #hometips", "timestamp": "2026-07-07T07:34:55.000Z", "videoDuration": 18.342, "videoPlayCount": 154428, "videoViewCount": 47848, "likesCount": -1, "commentsCount": 19, "displayUrl": "https://instagram.fcjs2-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/742077317_18099982190190993_2791390273532128887_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p1080x1080_sh2.08_tt6&_nc_ht=instagram.fcjs2-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_cat=109&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gEDFUBQYKUbPalPgRmGsBlFreD6PuMZeyvIpwzsWFRGfUrSsbxeKzekgwYxv_4Ib8xDbNWJPoE-ag931Imn3LOF&_nc_ohc=rru_7Eb0u7UQ7kNvwHKMdsN&_nc_gid=hjtFHYb8SlZocLk9CT6lDw&edm=ADp7STQBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AQGlXBYOsoUP-jlIDM_EPx-BXUVEr6OZSnj3stHuvXfb2A&oe=6A74F34F&_nc_sid=c6f216", "videoUrl": "https://instagram.fcjs2-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQM7mEbM3Fr3X9iblBmsoDCDGChvDQBu-XNvq_E8CcUffAdKnFV48Cs6dhR663D4ieKAFAYqS7ndYdC4CCIV9Q9mWj5QEGa5VIncRPI.mp4?_nc_cat=109&_nc_oc=AdoQy8uXnPWZRiNdoZHsvWEU3mOxv7vUU0GOXi55Z3zvbVI0TiGfA7BHN05y0brkjAHbvNzZkdfws7_9bkiF4mka&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=instagram.fcjs2-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=MydaySMZ9dIQ7kNvwH6ttIv&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJUFMuQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MSIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6MTk0NDQ3NDI2MzU5ODUzNiwiYXNzZXRfYWdlX2RheXMiOjI2LCJ2aV91c2VjYXNlX2lkIjoxMDA5OSwiZHVyYXRpb25fcyI6MTgsInVybGdlbl9zb3VyY2UiOiJ3d3cifQ%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&vs=59d185b9379f7e0d&_nc__0BhUCKAJDMywXQDJVP3ztkWgYEmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MREAdf4HZeadAQA&_nc_gid=hjtFHYb8SlZocLk9CT6lDw&_nc_zt=28&_nc_ss=7a22e&oh=00_AQGaaiIpalIooA6